{"seq":3,"slug":"r-performance-scaling","title":"R 性能优化与大数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/r-performance-scaling","wordCount":1213,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"r-性能优化与大数据\">R 性能优化与大数据</h1><p>R 的设计优先考虑统计表达力和交互式探索，而非原始速度。单线程解释器、copy-on-modify 语义、以及一切皆向量的内存模型，在数据超过数百万行时会成为瓶颈。但 R 生态已发展出成熟的解决路径：data.table 的引用语义在十亿行级别依然高效，Rcpp 让热点代码获得 C++ 速度，Arrow 和 DuckDB 将查询下推到列式引擎。性能优化的第一步永远是剖析——找到真正的瓶颈，而非凭直觉优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>先剖析再优化</strong>：profvis 火焰图定位整体瓶颈，<code>bench::mark()</code> 做多方案微基准比较。</li>\n<li><strong>data.table 的性能来自三个设计决策</strong>：引用修改避免复制、自动索引复用查询、GForce 在 C 层执行分组聚合。</li>\n<li><strong>Rcpp 是最后一个杠杆</strong>：只在循环确实不可向量化（递推、逐字符处理）时使用。</li>\n<li><strong>并行只对 embarrassingly parallel 问题有效</strong>：任务之间必须相互独立，future 提供统一抽象。</li>\n<li><strong>超出内存交给列式引擎</strong>：Arrow/Parquet 的延迟计算与 DuckDB 的进程内 SQL 避免了全量加载。</li>\n<li><strong>内存优化的核心是减少复制</strong>：预分配 + 一次性合并，按需读取列，用二进制格式替代 CSV。</li>\n<li><strong>数据规模决定方案选择</strong>：百万行用 dplyr，亿行用 data.table，更大规模用 Arrow/DuckDB。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"性能剖析\">性能剖析</h2><h3 id=\"profvis-可视化剖析\"><code>profvis</code> 可视化剖析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(profvis)&#10;&#10;profvis({&#10;  data &lt;- read.csv(&quot;large_file.csv&quot;)&#10;  cleaned &lt;- data |&gt;&#10;    dplyr::filter(!is.na(value)) |&gt;&#10;    dplyr::mutate(log_value = log(value + 1)) |&gt;&#10;    dplyr::group_by(category) |&gt;&#10;    dplyr::summarise(mean_val = mean(log_value))&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(profvis)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>profvis({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data &#x3C;- read.csv(\"large_file.csv\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cleaned &#x3C;- data |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dplyr::filter(!is.na(value)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dplyr::mutate(log_value = log(value + 1)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dplyr::group_by(category) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    dplyr::summarise(mean_val = mean(log_value))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})</span></span></code></pre></div><p>profvis 生成火焰图——纵轴是调用栈深度，横轴是时间。最宽的条就是瓶颈所在。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bench-微基准测试\"><code>bench</code> 微基准测试</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(bench)&#10;&#10;results &lt;- mark(&#10;  base_subset = df[df$x &gt; 0, ],&#10;  dplyr_filter = dplyr::filter(df, x &gt; 0),&#10;  dt_subset = dt[x &gt; 0],&#10;  check = FALSE,&#10;  min_iterations = 100&#10;)&#10;autoplot(results)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(bench)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- mark(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  base_subset = df[df$x > 0, ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dplyr_filter = dplyr::filter(df, x > 0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dt_subset = dt[x > 0],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  check = FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  min_iterations = 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>autoplot(results)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>剖析工具</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>profvis</code></td>\n<td>整体流程瓶颈定位</td>\n<td>火焰图 + 时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bench::mark()</code></td>\n<td>多方案微基准比较</td>\n<td>统计表 + 自动图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>system.time()</code></td>\n<td>快速粗略计时</td>\n<td>单次时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Rprof()</code></td>\n<td>无 GUI 环境剖析</td>\n<td>文本剖析数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lobstr::obj_size()</code></td>\n<td>内存占用分析</td>\n<td>对象真实大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"data-table-引用语义的极速数据操作\">data.table：引用语义的极速数据操作</h2><p>data.table 通过三个设计决策实现极致性能：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>引用修改</strong>（modify in place）：不复制数据</li>\n<li><strong>自动索引</strong>：首次查询建索引，后续查询复用</li>\n<li><strong>GForce</strong>：分组聚合由 C 层直接执行</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(data.table)&#10;&#10;# 创建 data.table&#10;dt &lt;- as.data.table(df)&#10;# 或直接读取（fread 比 read.csv 快 5-10 倍）&#10;dt &lt;- fread(&quot;large_file.csv&quot;, nThread = 4)&#10;&#10;# 基本语法：dt[i, j, by]&#10;# i = 行过滤, j = 列操作, by = 分组&#10;dt[age &gt; 30, .(mean_score = mean(score), n = .N), by = .(gender, region)]&#10;&#10;# 引用修改（不复制）&#10;dt[, log_value := log(value + 1)]&#10;dt[value &lt; 0, value := 0]&#10;&#10;# 链式操作&#10;dt[order(-score)][1:10]&#10;&#10;# 滚动连接&#10;dt1[dt2, on = .(id, date), roll = &quot;nearest&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(data.table)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 创建 data.table</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt &#x3C;- as.data.table(df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 或直接读取（fread 比 read.csv 快 5-10 倍）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt &#x3C;- fread(\"large_file.csv\", nThread = 4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 基本语法：dt[i, j, by]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># i = 行过滤, j = 列操作, by = 分组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt[age > 30, .(mean_score = mean(score), n = .N), by = .(gender, region)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 引用修改（不复制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt[, log_value := log(value + 1)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt[value &#x3C; 0, value := 0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 链式操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt[order(-score)][1:10]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 滚动连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt1[dt2, on = .(id, date), roll = \"nearest\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"data-table-vs-dplyr-性能对比\">data.table vs dplyr 性能对比</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[数据规模] --&gt; B{选择}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;&lt; 1M 行&quot;| C[dplyr 优先]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;1M - 100M 行&quot;| D[data.table 或 dtplyr]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;100M - 1B 行&quot;| E[data.table]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;&gt; 1B 行 / 磁盘数据&quot;| F[Arrow / DuckDB]&#10;    C --&gt; G[可读性优先]&#10;    D --&gt; H[性能敏感]&#10;    E --&gt; I[内存优化关键]&#10;    F --&gt; J[超出内存]\">graph LR\n    A[数据规模] --&gt; B{选择}\n    B --&gt;|\"&lt; 1M 行\"| C[dplyr 优先]\n    B --&gt;|\"1M - 100M 行\"| D[data.table 或 dtplyr]\n    B --&gt;|\"100M - 1B 行\"| E[data.table]\n    B --&gt;|\"&gt; 1B 行 / 磁盘数据\"| F[Arrow / DuckDB]\n    C --&gt; G[可读性优先]\n    D --&gt; H[性能敏感]\n    E --&gt; I[内存优化关键]\n    F --&gt; J[超出内存]</pre><h2 id=\"rcpp-c-集成\">Rcpp：C++ 集成</h2><p>当 R 循环不可避免（递推关系、复杂条件分支）时，Rcpp 提供了将热点下沉到 C++ 的无缝路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// fibonacci.cpp&#10;#include &lt;Rcpp.h&gt;&#10;using namespace Rcpp;&#10;&#10;// [[Rcpp::export]]&#10;NumericVector fibonacci_cpp(int n) {&#10;  NumericVector result(n);&#10;  result[0] = 0;&#10;  result[1] = 1;&#10;  for (int i = 2; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    result[i] = result[i-1] + result[i-2];&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// fibonacci.cpp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;Rcpp.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">using</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> namespace</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Rcpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [[Rcpp::export]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NumericVector</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fibonacci_cpp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  NumericVector </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  result[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"Rcpp::sourceCpp(&quot;fibonacci.cpp&quot;)&#10;fibonacci_cpp(20)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Rcpp::sourceCpp(\"fibonacci.cpp\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fibonacci_cpp(20)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"rcpparmadillo-线性代数\">RcppArmadillo 线性代数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;RcppArmadillo.h&gt;&#10;// [[Rcpp::depends(RcppArmadillo)]]&#10;&#10;// [[Rcpp::export]]&#10;arma::vec fast_ols(const arma::mat&amp; X, const arma::vec&amp; y) {&#10;  return arma::solve(X, y);  // 高效 QR 分解&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;RcppArmadillo.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [[Rcpp::depends(RcppArmadillo)]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [[Rcpp::export]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vec</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fast_ols</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> arma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> X</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> arma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> arma</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">solve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(X, y);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 高效 QR 分解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"何时使用-rcpp\">何时使用 Rcpp</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>加速比</th>\n<th>推荐</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>向量化可解决的</td>\n<td>1x（无收益）</td>\n<td>用 R 向量化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环内依赖前一步结果</td>\n<td>50-500x</td>\n<td>Rcpp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义滑动窗口</td>\n<td>20-100x</td>\n<td>Rcpp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串逐字符处理</td>\n<td>10-50x</td>\n<td>Rcpp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已有 C++ 库需调用</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>Rcpp / cpp11</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"并行计算\">并行计算</h2><h3 id=\"future-框架\"><code>future</code> 框架</h3><p>future 提供了统一的并行抽象——同一代码通过切换 plan 在串行/多核/分布式间无缝切换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(future)&#10;library(furrr)&#10;&#10;# 设置并行后端&#10;plan(multisession, workers = 4)  # 多进程&#10;# plan(multicore, workers = 4)   # 多线程（Linux/macOS）&#10;# plan(cluster, workers = c(&quot;host1&quot;, &quot;host2&quot;))  # 分布式&#10;&#10;# 并行版 purrr::map&#10;results &lt;- future_map(1:100, \\(i) {&#10;  # 耗时操作：模型拟合、模拟&#10;  simulate_experiment(seed = i)&#10;}, .options = furrr_options(seed = TRUE))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(future)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(furrr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 设置并行后端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plan(multisession, workers = 4)  # 多进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># plan(multicore, workers = 4)   # 多线程（Linux/macOS）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># plan(cluster, workers = c(\"host1\", \"host2\"))  # 分布式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 并行版 purrr::map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- future_map(1:100, \\(i) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 耗时操作：模型拟合、模拟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  simulate_experiment(seed = i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, .options = furrr_options(seed = TRUE))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"foreach-doparallel\"><code>foreach</code> + <code>doParallel</code></h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(foreach)&#10;library(doParallel)&#10;&#10;cl &lt;- makeCluster(4)&#10;registerDoParallel(cl)&#10;&#10;results &lt;- foreach(i = 1:1000, .combine = rbind, .packages = &quot;dplyr&quot;) %dopar% {&#10;  bootstrap_sample &lt;- df |&gt; slice_sample(n = nrow(df), replace = TRUE)&#10;  coef(lm(y ~ x, data = bootstrap_sample))&#10;}&#10;&#10;stopCluster(cl)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(foreach)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(doParallel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>cl &#x3C;- makeCluster(4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>registerDoParallel(cl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- foreach(i = 1:1000, .combine = rbind, .packages = \"dplyr\") %dopar% {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bootstrap_sample &#x3C;- df |> slice_sample(n = nrow(df), replace = TRUE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  coef(lm(y ~ x, data = bootstrap_sample))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stopCluster(cl)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"arrow-与-duckdb-超出内存的数据\">Arrow 与 DuckDB：超出内存的数据</h2><h3 id=\"arrow-列式内存格式\">Arrow：列式内存格式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(arrow)&#10;&#10;# 读取 Parquet（比 CSV 快 10-50 倍，体积小 5-10 倍）&#10;df &lt;- read_parquet(&quot;data.parquet&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 延迟计算：数据不全部加载到内存&#10;ds &lt;- open_dataset(&quot;data_lake/&quot;, format = &quot;parquet&quot;)&#10;result &lt;- ds |&gt;&#10;  filter(year == 2026, region == &quot;华东&quot;) |&gt;&#10;  group_by(category) |&gt;&#10;  summarise(total = sum(revenue)) |&gt;&#10;  collect()  # 只在 collect() 时执行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(arrow)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 读取 Parquet（比 CSV 快 10-50 倍，体积小 5-10 倍）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df &#x3C;- read_parquet(\"data.parquet\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 延迟计算：数据不全部加载到内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ds &#x3C;- open_dataset(\"data_lake/\", format = \"parquet\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- ds |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(year == 2026, region == \"华东\") |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(category) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  summarise(total = sum(revenue)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  collect()  # 只在 collect() 时执行</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"duckdb-进程内分析数据库\">DuckDB：进程内分析数据库</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(duckdb)&#10;library(dplyr)&#10;&#10;con &lt;- dbConnect(duckdb())&#10;&#10;# 直接查询 Parquet 文件（无需加载到 R 内存）&#10;tbl(con, &quot;read_parquet(&#39;data/*.parquet&#39;)&quot;) |&gt;&#10;  filter(date &gt;= &quot;2026-01-01&quot;) |&gt;&#10;  group_by(category) |&gt;&#10;  summarise(n = n(), total = sum(amount)) |&gt;&#10;  collect()&#10;&#10;# 注册 R 数据框为虚拟表&#10;duckdb_register(con, &quot;my_table&quot;, large_df)&#10;dbGetQuery(con, &quot;SELECT category, AVG(value) FROM my_table GROUP BY 1&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(duckdb)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>library(dplyr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>con &#x3C;- dbConnect(duckdb())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 直接查询 Parquet 文件（无需加载到 R 内存）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tbl(con, \"read_parquet('data/*.parquet')\") |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(date >= \"2026-01-01\") |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(category) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  summarise(n = n(), total = sum(amount)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 注册 R 数据框为虚拟表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>duckdb_register(con, \"my_table\", large_df)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dbGetQuery(con, \"SELECT category, AVG(value) FROM my_table GROUP BY 1\")</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>数据位置</th>\n<th>典型数据量</th>\n<th>R 接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>data.table</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>1-50 GB</td>\n<td><code>dt[i, j, by]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arrow Dataset</td>\n<td>磁盘（Parquet）</td>\n<td>10 GB - 1 TB</td>\n<td>dplyr 语法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DuckDB</td>\n<td>磁盘或内存</td>\n<td>1 GB - 100 GB</td>\n<td>SQL 或 dplyr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spark (sparklyr)</td>\n<td>分布式集群</td>\n<td>&gt; 1 TB</td>\n<td>dplyr 语法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"内存优化策略\">内存优化策略</h2><h3 id=\"减少复制\">减少复制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 坏：每次 rbind 触发复制&#10;result &lt;- data.frame()&#10;for (i in 1:1000) {&#10;  result &lt;- rbind(result, compute_row(i))  # O(n^2)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 好：预分配列表 + 一次性合并&#10;results &lt;- vector(&quot;list&quot;, 1000)&#10;for (i in 1:1000) {&#10;  results[[i]] &lt;- compute_row(i)&#10;}&#10;final &lt;- data.table::rbindlist(results)  # O(n)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 坏：每次 rbind 触发复制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result &#x3C;- data.frame()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (i in 1:1000) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result &#x3C;- rbind(result, compute_row(i))  # O(n^2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 好：预分配列表 + 一次性合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results &#x3C;- vector(\"list\", 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (i in 1:1000) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  results[[i]] &#x3C;- compute_row(i)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final &#x3C;- data.table::rbindlist(results)  # O(n)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"按需读取\">按需读取</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# fread 只读取需要的列&#10;dt &lt;- fread(&quot;huge.csv&quot;, select = c(&quot;id&quot;, &quot;date&quot;, &quot;value&quot;))&#10;&#10;# Arrow 的列裁剪 + 行过滤下推&#10;ds &lt;- open_dataset(&quot;data/&quot;) |&gt;&#10;  select(id, date, value) |&gt;&#10;  filter(date &gt; &quot;2025-01-01&quot;) |&gt;&#10;  collect()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># fread 只读取需要的列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dt &#x3C;- fread(\"huge.csv\", select = c(\"id\", \"date\", \"value\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Arrow 的列裁剪 + 行过滤下推</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ds &#x3C;- open_dataset(\"data/\") |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  select(id, date, value) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(date > \"2025-01-01\") |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  collect()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"对象清理\">对象清理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"rm(large_temp_object)&#10;gc()  # 触发垃圾回收（通常不需要手动调用）&#10;&#10;# 检查当前内存使用&#10;pryr::mem_used()&#10;lobstr::obj_size(my_data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>rm(large_temp_object)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>gc()  # 触发垃圾回收（通常不需要手动调用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 检查当前内存使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pryr::mem_used()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lobstr::obj_size(my_data)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"生产环境最佳实践\">生产环境最佳实践</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>先剖析再优化</strong>：用 profvis 定位瓶颈，不要凭直觉</li>\n<li><strong>向量化优先</strong>：80% 的性能问题通过消除 R 层循环解决——参见<a href=\"../fundamentals/vectorized-operations\">向量化运算与函数式编程</a></li>\n<li><strong>选择正确的数据结构</strong>：data.table 的引用修改避免大量复制</li>\n<li><strong>I/O 用二进制格式</strong>：Parquet/Arrow IPC 替代 CSV</li>\n<li><strong>并行化独立任务</strong>：future/furrr 对 embarrassingly parallel 问题有效</li>\n<li><strong>热点下沉 C++</strong>：Rcpp 处理不可向量化的算法核心</li>\n<li><strong>超出内存交给引擎</strong>：DuckDB/Arrow 的延迟计算避免全量加载</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关于 R 包开发中的性能测试和基准设施，参见<a href=\"../fundamentals/r-package-ecosystem\">R 包生态与开发</a>中 testthat + bench 的集成模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>剖析是性能工作的起点，profvis 看整体、bench 看细节、<code>system.time()</code> 只适合粗略估计。</li>\n<li>data.table 的引用语义是 R 中少见的&quot;就地修改&quot;，在十亿行级别依然是内存内方案的首选。</li>\n<li>Rcpp 的收益与向量化程度成反比：能向量化的场景用 Rcpp 没有收益，递推与逐字符处理才有 50-500 倍差距。</li>\n<li>future/furrr 提供了可切换后端，让并行代码在串行与多核之间零成本迁移。</li>\n<li>Arrow 与 DuckDB 把计算下推到列式引擎，是突破内存上限的关键路径。</li>\n<li>内存优化的三条主线是减少复制、按需读取与及时清理，其中预分配比任何微优化都更有效。</li>\n<li>七条生产实践的核心次序不变：先剖析，再向量化，最后才考虑 C++ 与外部引擎。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"R 性能优化与大数据","id":"r-性能优化与大数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"性能剖析","id":"性能剖析"},{"level":3,"text":"`profvis` 可视化剖析","id":"profvis-可视化剖析"},{"level":3,"text":"`bench` 微基准测试","id":"bench-微基准测试"},{"level":2,"text":"data.table：引用语义的极速数据操作","id":"data-table-引用语义的极速数据操作"},{"level":3,"text":"data.table vs dplyr 性能对比","id":"data-table-vs-dplyr-性能对比"},{"level":2,"text":"Rcpp：C++ 集成","id":"rcpp-c-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"RcppArmadillo 线性代数","id":"rcpparmadillo-线性代数"},{"level":3,"text":"何时使用 Rcpp","id":"何时使用-rcpp"},{"level":2,"text":"并行计算","id":"并行计算"},{"level":3,"text":"`future` 框架","id":"future-框架"},{"level":3,"text":"`foreach` + `doParallel`","id":"foreach-doparallel"},{"level":2,"text":"Arrow 与 DuckDB：超出内存的数据","id":"arrow-与-duckdb-超出内存的数据"},{"level":3,"text":"Arrow：列式内存格式","id":"arrow-列式内存格式"},{"level":3,"text":"DuckDB：进程内分析数据库","id":"duckdb-进程内分析数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"内存优化策略","id":"内存优化策略"},{"level":3,"text":"减少复制","id":"减少复制"},{"level":3,"text":"按需读取","id":"按需读取"},{"level":3,"text":"对象清理","id":"对象清理"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境最佳实践","id":"生产环境最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"R Markdown 与 Quarto 报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/applications/rmarkdown-quarto"},"next":null}